## ✨ Features Implemented

### Core App Features (Main App Clone)
✅ **Grid View** - Thumbnails in resizable grid layout  
✅ **Ctrl+Wheel Zoom** - Resize grid from 40-400px  
✅ **Click → PhotoViewer** - Single image full-screen mode  
✅ **PhotoViewer Navigation** - Swipe left/right, zoom in/out  
✅ **Recursive Folder Scan** - Loads ALL images from subdirectories  
✅ **Video Support** - Plays MP4/AVI/MKV/MOV files  

### Performance Testing Features
✅ **Floating Performance Overlay** - Top-right corner, closeable  
✅ **FPS Monitoring** - Color-coded (green ≥55, yellow ≥30, red <30)  
✅ **Queue Depth** - Real-time pending decode count  
✅ **Memory Usage** - Live MB counter  
✅ **Viewport Culling Toggle** - Enable/disable viewport-based loading  
✅ **Frame Budget Control** - 1-50 uploads per frame slider  
✅ **Thumb Resolution** - 128-512px quality setting (NOT grid size)  

